  {
   "description": "Bounded simulator subset of the official AWS SecurityHub API (2018-10-26). Every other official operation returns HTTP 501 UnknownOperationException. Custom action targets and custom insights are configuration metadata that need no prior EnableSecurityHub call: no finding is ingested or sent to EventBridge, and insight results are never computed. Managed insights are not listed. Hub enablement, findings, standards, controls, automation rules, configuration policies, aggregators, members and tagging return UnknownOperationException with HTTP 501.",
   "name": "AWS Security Hub"
  }
